  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eskhata Bank Supporting Green Finance to Micro, Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADB assistance will support Eskhata Bank (EB) to scale up its portfolio of climate sustainable loans to micro, small and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs). This transaction will enable EB to provide much needed financing to MSMEs to invest in technology solutions that reduce the consumption of energy, water, raw materials, and other resources used in the business processes and/or to develop renewable energy production.</narrative>
  </description>
